<title>UK: BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague basketball matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Berlin:</p>
<p>Alba Berlin (Germany) 62 Olympiakos Piraeus 61 (halftime 31-29)</p>
<p>Leading scorers</p>
<p>Alba Berlin - Alexis 21, Obradovic 14</p>
<p>Olympiakos Piraeus - Tarlac 18, Anderson 13, Rivers 13</p>
